 system from scratch to automate email uploads using CSV and HTML templates with dynamic placeholders using Angular, Express.js, MySQL, and Socket.io.",{"className":"text-sm text-secondary-text-light dark:text-secondary-text-dark","children":"Hubspot to Mambu Email Upload: Built a system from scratch to automate email uploads using CSV and HTML templates with dynamic placeholders using Angular, Express.js, MySQL, and Socket.io."}],["$","li","Collateral Search: Integrated Google Maps APIs to visualize loan collaterals and built React frontend with Node.js backend from scratch using geolocation and radius search.",{"className":"text-sm text-secondary-text-light dark:text-secondary-text-dark","children":"Collateral Search: Integrated Google Maps APIs to visualize loan collaterals and built React frontend with Node.js backend from scratch using geolocation and radius search."}],["$","li","Retail Deposit Journey: Contributed to account onboarding and investment portal, adding features and maintaining a scalable React.js frontend.",{"className":"text-sm text-secondary-text-light dark:text-secondary-text-dark","children":"Retail Deposit Journey: Contributed to account onboarding and investment portal, adding features and maintaining a scalable React.js frontend."}],["$","li","Contributed to internal React.js UI library by building reusable components with Styled Components and documenting them in Storybook.",{"className":"text-sm text-secondary-text-light dark:text-secondary-text-dark","children":"Contributed to internal React.js UI library by building reusable components with Styled Components and documenting them in Storybook."}],"$L28","$L29"]}],"$L2a"]}]
