rds and participant management tools."}],["$","li","Delivered Procam Registration and Admin Portals from scratch for physical event management, implementing registration workflows, dashboards, and participant statistics with Angular and Angular Material.",{"className":"text-sm text-secondary-text-light dark:text-secondary-text-dark","children":"Delivered Procam Registration and Admin Portals from scratch for physical event management, implementing registration workflows, dashboards, and participant statistics with Angular and Angular Material."}],["$","li","Maintained and enhanced the E-Compliance Suite (LCM-FCM, DMS, Phase and Event) using Java Spring and Hibernate, improving compliance management and scheduling workflows.",{"className":"text-sm text-secondary-text-light dark:text-secondary-text-dark","children":"Maintained and enhanced the E-Compliance Suite (LCM-FCM, DMS, Phase and Event) using Java Spring and Hibernate, improving compliance management and scheduling workflows."}],["$","li","Built multiple admin dashboards from scratch for event moderation, reporting, and user management with Angular, Angular Material, Bootstrap, and custom CSS.",{"className":"text-sm text-secondary-text-light dark:text-secondary-text-dark","children":"Built multiple admin dashboards from scratch for event moderation, reporting, and user management with Angular, Angular Material, Bootstrap, and custom CSS."}],["$","li","Started as a solo developer on HDOR event platforms and grew into a team lead managing three frontend developers, driving delivery and mentoring juniors.",{"className":"text-sm text-secondary-text-light dark:text-secondary-text-dark","children":"Started as a solo developer on HDOR event platforms and grew into a team lead managing three frontend developers, driving delivery and mentoring juniors."}],"$L2b","$L2c"]}],"$L2d"]}]
19:["$","$L2e","projects",{"content":{"sectionId":"projects","title":"Project Portfolio","intro":"Selected projects delivered across Gateway Software Solutions, OakNorth Global, and HDOR Events with clear ownership from build to maintenance.","previewCount":3,"showAllLabel":"Show All Projects","allProjectsPath":"/projects","inquiryCtaLabel":"Enquire About This Project","inquiryHref":"/contact","items":[{"id":"hdor-multi-portal-ecosystem","title":"HDOR App Multi-Portal Ecosystem","role":"Frontend Lead (React Developer)","client":"HDOR Events Pvt. Ltd. (2023 - Present)","domain":"Event Management","status":"Live","duration":"2023 - Present","summary":"Designed and built User, Registration, Activity, and Authentication portals from scratch for large-scale event journeys.","responsibilities":["Built User portal modules for dashboards, reports, profiles, coupons, referrals, and downloadable certificates/banners.","Implemented complete Registration flow including addresses, orders, and payment gateway integration.","Developed Activity portal for run, ride, and steps tracking with detailed infographics and summaries.","Designed secure Authentication workflows and reusable frontend architecture for scalability."],"outcome":"Unified multiple event journeys into a scalable platform used across virtual and physical events.","stack":["React.js","TypeScript","Node.js","Payment Gateway","Analytics"]},{"id":"hdor-admin-portal","title":"HDOR Admin Portal","role":"Frontend Lead (React Developer)","client":"HDOR Events Pvt. Ltd. (2023 - Present)","domain":"Event Operations","status":"Live","duration":"2023 - Present","summary":"Built admin operations platform from scratch to manage events, users, masters, and moderation workflows.","responsibilities":["Built admin portal architecture and key flows for event and user management.","Implemented CRUD modules for Pincode, Country, State, and City master data.","Developed user operations features including profile updates, event details, activity logs, and certificate downloads.","Added moderation workflows for validating activity authenticity and consistency."],"outcome":"Reduced manual operations and improved governance for high-volume event execution.","stack":["React.js","TypeScript","Node.js","REST APIs"]},{"id":"hdor-organiser-portal","title":"HDOR Organiser Portal","role":"Frontend Lead (React Developer)","client":"HDOR Events Pvt. Ltd. (2023 - Present)","domain":"Event Operations","status":"Live","duration":"2023 - Present","summary":"Developed organiser-focused portal from scratch with role-based workflows and revenue-aware event operations.","responsibilities":["Built organiser request and approval flows with role-based access control.","Implemented modules for event creation, discounts, ticketing, participant operations, and revenue tracking.","Designed scalable frontend architecture and shared patterns across apps."],"outcome":"Improved organiser efficiency and standardized operational flow across event programs.","stack":["React.js","TypeScript","RBAC","REST APIs"]},{"id":"app-header-web-component","title":"Common App Header Web Component","role":"React Developer","client":"HDOR Events Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"Frontend Platform","status":"Production","duration":"2024","summary":"Built a reusable header as a web component for consistent navigation across multiple web apps.","responsibilities":["Developed reusable header component in React.js and exported it as a web component.","Configured behavior dynamically using JSON config, user roles, and tokens.","Enabled cross-application reuse with minimal integration effort."],"outcome":"Standardized navigation UX and reduced duplicate implementation across apps.","stack":["React.js","Web Components","JavaScript","JSON Config"]},{"id":"ads-sdk","title":"Reusable Ads SDK","role":"JavaScript Developer","client":"HDOR Events Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"AdTech","status":"Production","duration":"2024","summary":"Created a lightweight ads SDK packaged for plug-and-play integration across portal apps.","responsibilities":["Built SDK using JavaScript, HTML, and CSS for dynamic ad rendering.","Added JSON-based configuration and GTM tracking compatibility.","Packaged as independent web component for seamless integration."],"outcome":"Enabled faster ad rollout and centralized tracking across multiple products.","stack":["JavaScript","HTML","CSS","Google Tag Manager","Web Components"]},{"id":"hdor-celebration-video","title":"HDOR Celebration Video Generator","role":"Node.js Developer","client":"HDOR Events Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"Automation","status":"Production","duration":"2024","summary":"Built personalized participant celebration video generation and delivery workflow.","responsibilities":["Developed Node.js services to fetch participant data and build personalized stats payloads.","Used React Remotion templates for automated video rendering.","Automated participant communication by emailing video links after generation."],"outcome":"Increased participant engagement through automated personalized media delivery.","stack":["Node.js","React Remotion","Email Automation","Template Rendering"]},{"id":"npa-registration-admin","title":"NPA Registration Portal and Admin","role":"Angular Developer","client":"HDOR Events Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"Event Registration","status":"Maintained","duration":"2024 - Present","summary":"Built and maintained registration and admin modules for NPA event workflows.","responsibilities":["Built and enhanced participant registration flows using Angular 2+.","Developed admin dashboard modules for user management and event statistics.","Maintained production workflows and delivered iterative feature updates."],"outcome":"Improved reliability and control of NPA event onboarding and operations.","stack":["Angular 2+","TypeScript","Dashboards","Admin Workflows"]},{"id":"procam-registration-admin-v2","title":"Procam Registration Portal and Admin (v2)","role":"Frontend Lead (Angular Developer)","client":"HDOR Events Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"Sports Events","status":"Live","duration":"2024 - Present","summary":"Led build and enhancement of Procam registration and admin systems for large-scale physical events.","responsibilities":["Built and maintained participant registration and admin modules in Angular 2+.","Implemented user management, dashboards, and event statistics workflows.","Led frontend architecture decisions with focus on performance and scalability."],"outcome":"Supported large event registrations with stable and scalable frontend flows.","stack":["Angular 2+","TypeScript","Angular Material","Performance Optimization"]},{"id":"cc-portal-v2","title":"CC Portal v2","role":"Frontend Lead (Angular Developer)","client":"HDOR Events Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"Internal Platform","status":"Active","duration":"2024 - Present","summary":"Developed CC Portal v2 with modular frontend architecture and ongoing enhancements.","responsibilities":["Designed modular Angular architecture for versioned feature delivery.","Owned continuous feature enhancements and maintenance across releases.","Maintained architecture consistency and development standards."],"outcome":"Delivered a maintainable base for faster iteration and lower regression risk.","stack":["Angular","TypeScript","Modular Architecture","Maintenance"]},{"id":"vendor-portal","title":"Vendor Portal","role":"Frontend Lead (Angular Developer)","client":"HDOR Events Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"Partner Operations","status":"Live","duration":"2024 - Present","summary":"Built vendor operations portal from scratch to streamline partner workflows and tracking.","responsibilities":["Designed and developed vendor modules for event-related tasks and data tracking.","Owned feature development, enhancements, and lifecycle maintenance.","Ensured architecture alignment and shared frontend best practices."],"outcome":"Improved visibility and operational consistency for vendor-side event management.","stack":["Angular","TypeScript","Dashboards","Workflow Management"]},{"id":"elevate","title":"Elevate","role":"React Developer","client":"OakNorth Global Private Limited (2021 - 2023)","domain":"Banking","status":"Discontinued","duration":"2021 - 2023","summary":"Built core frontend modules from scratch for account operations in a banking product.","responsibilities":["Developed user-facing frontend using React.js in an agile ticket-driven environment.","Built account management modules including add money, move money, and reinvestment flows.","Collaborated across sprint cycles for modular, incremental releases."],"outcome":"Delivered core functional modules before project closure due to management decisions.","stack":["React.js","JavaScript","REST APIs","Agile"]},{"id":"collateral-search","title":"Collateral Search","role":"React Developer, Node.js Developer","client":"OakNorth Global Private Limited","domain":"Banking","status":"Live","duration":"2021 - 2023","summary":"Built collateral discovery system with React, Node.js, and Google Maps for geospatial loan collateral search.","responsibilities":["Developed and maintained React.js frontend with interactive maps and data tables.","Built Node.js backend APIs to support real-time collateral search workflows.","Integrated Google Geo APIs and radius-based filters for geolocation-driven exploration."],"outcome":"Improved collateral visibility and faster decision support for banking operations.","stack":["React.js","Node.js","Express.js","Google Maps API","MySQL"]},{"id":"business-portal-suite","title":"Business Portal Suite","role":"Angular Developer, Node.js Developer","client":"OakNorth Global Private Limited","domain":"Banking Operations","status":"Production","duration":"2021 - 2023","summary":"Designed and maintained enterprise Angular + Node.js applications for communication, automation, and controlled execution flows.","responsibilities":["Built Rate Change Communication flow with dynamic templates, preview, approvals, and real-time progress tracking.","Developed Rate Change Automation with validation, approval, execution, and rollback using Socket.io updates.","Implemented HubSpot to Mambu Email Upload with CSV + HTML templates and approval-to-execution workflows."],"outcome":"Automated high-volume operational workflows while improving control and traceability.","stack":["Angular","Node.js","Express.js","Socket.io","MySQL"]},{"id":"retail-deposit-journey","title":"Retail Deposit Journey","role":"React Developer","client":"OakNorth Global Private Limited","domain":"Banking","status":"Production","duration":"2021 - 2023","summary":"Contributed to feature enhancements and maintenance of a customer-facing banking portal built in React.","responsibilities":["Implemented and maintained customer onboarding and investment/reinvestment features.","Delivered iterative enhancements through agile, ticket-driven development cycles.","Collaborated with product and engineering teams to ensure release quality."],"outcome":"Improved customer account journey consistency and release velocity.","stack":["React.js","JavaScript","REST APIs","Agile"]},{"id":"hdor-100-days-running-admin","title":"HDOR - 100 Days of Running and Admin","role":"Angular Developer","client":"Gateway Software Solutions Pvt. Ltd. (2018 - 2021)","domain":"Fitness Events","status":"Production","duration":"2018 - 2021","summary":"Built flagship HDOR participant platform and admin portal from scratch for one of India's largest multi-day fitness challenges.","responsibilities":["Developed frontend from scratch in Angular with payment gateway, multi-language support, and Google Charts.","Built admin portal for user management, event stats, reporting, moderation, and certificate downloads.","Delivered features supporting large-scale participation and event operations."],"outcome":"Successfully supported high-scale challenge operations with global participants.","stack":["Angular","TypeScript","Google Charts","Payment Gateway","Multi-language"]},{"id":"tdh-tour-de-100-admin","title":"TDH - Tour De 100 and Admin","role":"Angular Developer","client":"Gateway Software Solutions Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"Cycling Events","status":"Production","duration":"2018 - 2021","summary":"Built frontend and admin ecosystem for a global 5-stage cycling challenge platform.","responsibilities":["Developed application independently in Angular with charts, payment integration, and multilingual support.","Implemented participant leaderboard and points-focused challenge experience.","Built admin dashboard for participant operations, event updates, and reporting."],"outcome":"Enabled smooth delivery of multi-stage challenge experience and administrative control.","stack":["Angular","TypeScript","Google Charts","Payment Gateway","Multi-language"]},{"id":"runners-club-admin","title":"Runners Club and Admin","role":"Angular Developer","client":"Gateway Software Solutions Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"Fitness Events","status":"Production","duration":"2018 - 2021","summary":"Built a localized HDOR replica for Romanian clients with map-enabled event flows and themed UX.","responsibilities":["Developed Angular frontend with Google Maps, multi-language support, and custom theming.","Built admin dashboard for user administration and reporting.","Delivered client-specific localization and platform behavior."],"outcome":"Launched localized event product aligned to regional user expectations.","stack":["Angular","Google Maps","TypeScript","Multi-language"]},{"id":"neb-sports-admin","title":"NEB Sports and Admin","role":"Angular Developer","client":"Gateway Software Solutions Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"Sports Events","status":"Production","duration":"2018 - 2021","summary":"Built HDOR-like event platform and admin tools for participant operations and reporting.","responsibilities":["Designed and developed event app modules with stats, multilingual support, and theme customization.","Built admin portal for dashboards, participant updates, and reporting operations.","Maintained consistent architecture patterns across event products."],"outcome":"Improved operational efficiency for sports event administration and tracking.","stack":["Angular","TypeScript","Dashboards","Multi-language"]},{"id":"procam-registration-admin-v1","title":"Procam Registration and Admin (v1)","role":"Angular Developer","client":"Gateway Software Solutions Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"Physical Events","status":"Production","duration":"2018 - 2021","summary":"Built registration and admin systems for Procam physical event management workflows.","responsibilities":["Developed registration platform workflows in Angular 2+ for participant onboarding.","Built admin modules for dashboards, user management, and event statistics.","Streamlined registration and operations for large-scale physical events."],"outcome":"Stabilized registration and event administration for high-volume event programs.","stack":["Angular 2+","TypeScript","Angular Material","Dashboards"]},{"id":"e-compliance-suite","title":"E-Compliance Suite (LCM-FCM, DMS, Phase and Event Scheduler)","role":"Java Developer","client":"Gateway Software Solutions Pvt. Ltd.","domain":"Compliance","status":"Production","duration":"2018 - 2021","summary":"Maintained and enhanced Java-based compliance applications used for labor, finance, document, and schedule management.","responsibilities":["Enhanced LCM-FCM modules for labor and finance compliance administration.","Improved DMS document upload and digital tracking workflows.","Maintained and enhanced phase and event scheduling flows for internal and external use."],"outcome":"Improved reliability and usability of core compliance operations.","stack":["Java","Spring","Hibernate","MySQL","Apache Tomcat"]}]},"mode":"preview"}]
